		}
	}
	// Dedupe specs? Original: does it dedupe deps? For `import "./a.js"; import "./a.js";` twice, tree shows one (since map). For check, one violation (since deduped). For entropy links, one link (not two)? Likely deduped. We'll dedupe, but preserve first occurrence order.
