	// For now, read from files? We'll embed via //go:embed in this package? Or read from internal/entropy/prefix.html at runtime? Since compile.sh builds from workspace, prefix.html is at internal/entropy/prefix.html relative to binary? No, binary is at ./executable, template files are not available at runtime (unless embedded). Must embed via go:embed.
